],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1827330","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"La mortale \"stella a croce\"","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"渓谷を走る列車が、天邪教という集団に襲われた。偶然乗り合わせた三四郎は、病気の姉に薬を届けるという少年と、暴走する列車から脱出する。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1827332","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"L'oro spagnolo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"殺された船員の言葉から、仇と思わしき男に会うために貨物船に乗り込む三四郎。海に沈んだ金貨を巡り、十年前から続く忌まわしい事件に巻き込まれる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1827334","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"I super uomini ombra","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"シャドーマンと呼ばれる覆面強盗団に襲われた三四郎。謎の博士によってコントロール装置を埋め込まれ、身体の自由を奪われその仲間にされてしまう。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1827335","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Duello sulla neve","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"父を殺したのと同じ技を使う男と出会った三四郎は、その男こそ仇であると確信し後を追う。しかし、返り討ちに合い、谷底に転落してしまう。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1827337","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Il castello di Sandoria","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"占い師の言葉に触発された三四郎は、砂漠の城へと向かう。そこはかつて武術で栄えた古代王国の城で、亡霊たちが三四郎に襲い掛かる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"1827339","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"I guerrieri del Kilimangiaro","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"旅の途中で出会った兄を探す少女と、キリマンジャロの村を訪れた三四郎。文明人を嫌う村民に捕らわれるが、そのリーダーこそが彼女の兄であった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"1827340","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Duello al tramonto","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"墓場だらけの村へとやってきた三四郎。静まり返りまるでゴーストタウンのようなその村は、５人のならず者に脅かされていた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"1827342","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Appuntamento con la morte","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"突然スパイ容疑を掛けられた三四郎は、要塞のような刑務所に投獄される。裁判もなく死刑を宣告され、隣の独房の女スパイと脱獄を図ることに。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"1827343","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Gli allievi dei killers","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ギャングのボスが集まって殺し屋のオリンピックを開き、大ボスの後継者を決めるという。秘密警察に内偵を依頼された三四郎は、ギャングの会合に潜り込む。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"1827345","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Il cane giustiziere","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"野犬の群れに襲われている男を救い、屋敷に招待された三四郎達。そこに住む男の姪である少女に頼まれ、ケン坊は彼女を屋敷から抜け出させる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"1827347","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Sul fondo del mare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"悪徳高利貸しに騙され、借金に追われる孤児院。偶然通りかかり、暴れる借金取りを追い払った三四郎は、借金返済のために武術大会に出場する。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"1827348","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Il genere Guercio","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"戦車部隊を指揮する将軍を探して、紛争地帯へとやって来た三四郎。銃弾の飛び交う中、ならず者部隊のくせ者たちと共に戦場を進む。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"1827350","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Il fantasma del castello","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"森の古城に暮らす父娘を狙う、処刑された提督の亡霊。怪しい使用人たちの徘徊する城で、三四郎は亡霊の正体を暴こうとする。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-07-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"1827352","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Il denaro o l'amicizia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"犯罪組織から抜けて恋人と暮らすため、組織の金を持ち出して逃走を図った男。負傷した彼を助けた三四郎であったが、部屋を空けた隙に男は捕らわれてしまった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"1827354","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"L'occhio della tigre (prima parte)","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ついに仇の男と対峙した三四郎であったが、あえなく敗北する。失意の中、紅流を捨てようとするが、自分と同様に白虎を父の仇と狙う少年に出会う。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"1827356","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"L'occhio della tigre (seconda parte)","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"白虎を倒そうとする少年カミールを鍛えるうちに、闘志を取り戻していく三四郎。紅流を学んだカミールと共に、白虎に闘いを挑む。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"1827358","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Gli abitanti del sottosuolo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"険しい岩山を進んでいた三四郎は、貴重な鉱石を探す怪しい一団に襲われる。ケン坊を人質に取られ探索を手伝わされた三四郎は、地底の王国へと迷い込む。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-08-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"1827359","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"La forca o la verità","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"立ち寄った村で村長の殺害容疑を掛けられ、投獄された三四郎。疑いを晴らす為に脱獄するが、村人たちに追い詰められていく。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-09-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"1827361","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Il colpo mortale","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"突如サーカスに現れ、団長に詰め寄る一人の男。三四郎は団長の娘の手を借り、サーカスに潜り込んで再び男が現れるのを待つことに。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-09-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/24"},{"id":"1827363","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Il villaggio delle scimmie","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ジャングルの村の襲撃者を探し、三四郎は川の上流へと向かう。そこで服を着て道具を使う、巨大な猿の集団に襲われる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-09-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/43903/season/1/episode/25"},{"id":"1827365","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"La ragazza intrepida","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"剣術使いの少女マリと出会った三四郎。父親を探しているというマリと途中まで一緒の旅となるが、彼女が向かった街は犯罪者たちの巣窟であった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"1969-09-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"stills"